{"id":"1b2e9f6ae1c2ae24","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepCBVRow.md","title":"LStepCBVRow","display":"LStepCBVRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LStepCBVRow","parameters":["z1121","z1122","z1123"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LStepCBVRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1121</span><span>z1122</span><span>z1123</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>z1121</code>、<code>z1122</code>、<code>z1123</code>。</p>\n<p>指定策略的一步规约；非规约传递闭包。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LStepCBVRow z1121 z1122 z1123)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists u\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t u z1123)\n      (and\n        (@ AnyRaw t)\n        (and\n          (@ AnyRaw u)\n          (or\n            (exists z1126\n              (exists z1127\n                (exists z1129\n                  (exists z1130\n                    (and\n                      (@ Num0 z1126)\n                      (and\n                        (@ TApp z1127 z1130 t)\n                        (and\n                          (or (@ ULam z1129 z1127) (exists z1128 (@ TLam z1128 z1129 z1127)))\n                          (and (@ LInst z1126 z1130 z1129 u) (@ LValueOpen z1130)))))))))\n            (or\n              (exists z1131\n                (exists z1132\n                  (exists z1133\n                    (and\n                      (@ TApp z1131 z1132 t)\n                      (and\n                        (@ TApp z1133 z1132 u)\n                        (exists z1137\n                          (exists z1138 (and (in z1137 z1122) (and (@ App z1121 z1137 z1138) (@ Pair z1131 z1133 z1138))))))))))\n              (exists z1131\n                (exists z1132\n                  (exists z1134\n                    (and\n                      (@ TApp z1131 z1132 t)\n                      (and\n                        (@ TApp z1131 z1134 u)\n                        (and\n                          (@ LValueOpen z1131)\n                          (exists z1139\n                            (exists z1140 (and (in z1139 z1122) (and (@ App z1121 z1139 z1140) (@ Pair z1132 z1134 z1140))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"487e9a7343d4d692\" href=\"?note=487e9a7343d4d692\" title=\"ZFC_AnyRaw\">AnyRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0022091441242a73\" href=\"?note=0022091441242a73\" title=\"ZFC_LInst\">LInst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9af2e908dee7a1f1\" href=\"?note=9af2e908dee7a1f1\" title=\"ZFC_LValueOpen\">LValueOpen</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ LStepCBVRow z1121 z1122 z1123)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_AnyRaw","status":"resolved","id":"487e9a7343d4d692","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_LInst","status":"resolved","id":"0022091441242a73","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_LValueOpen","status":"resolved","id":"9af2e908dee7a1f1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","locati